msgid ""
"Sending ESC data to the GCS requires using MAVLink2.  Please check the "
"appropriate SERIALx_PROTOCOL parameter is 2 (where \"x\" is the serial port "
"number used for the telemetry connection)."
msgstr ""
"将 ESC 数据发送到 GCS 需要使用 MAVLink2。请检查相应的 SERIALx_PROTOCOL 参数是否为 2（其中 「x」 "
"是用于数传连接的串口编号）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:46
#: f5aeff76ea5140a498a4341a60431876
msgid ""
"Set ``SERVOx_MIN`` = 1000 and ``SERVOx_MAX`` = 2000 for each ESC connected "
"(``x`` corresponds to the ESC number) so ArduPilot uses an output range that"
" matches the ESCs input range"
msgstr ""
"为每个已连接的 ESC 设置 ``SERVOx_MIN`` = 1000、``SERVOx_MAX`` = 2000（``x`` 对应 ESC "
"编号），使 ArduPilot 输出范围与 ESC 输入范围匹配"
